data: {"id": "fd7f73eafde04288-thinking-parallel_evidence-2823", "run_id": "fd7f73eafde04288", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我有了完整的证据链。让我总结调查发现的 **事实、冲突和缺口**：\n\n---\n\n## 调查结果\n\n### ✅ 确认事实（支持 ImagePullFailed 根因）\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`Pending`，未运行，`Ready=False`\n2. **镜像拉取失败详情**（来自 kubectl_describe 和 kubectl_get_yaml）：\n   - **镜像地址**：`registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`\n   - **错误原文**：`Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/workload/manifests/missing\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`\n3. **事件记录**：`BackOff` 原因，共 349 次，持续 **83 分钟**\n4. **重启次数**：0（从未成功启动）\n5. **imagePullSecrets**：`<absent>`（无认证凭", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788414923222, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

